    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Safety</strong> is a retro arcade game where you take on the role of a platform operator in a mining facility. Your job is to control a mobile structure to guide the little miners to the exit elevator \u2014 preferably alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.poster.avif?t=1750357673\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.webm?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.mp4?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine never stops, and the machinery must stay on at all times. High-speed rotating drills are constantly digging in every direction, posing a deadly threat to the little miners. According to your contract, you're legally allowed to cause only a few workplace accidents. Go over the limit? You're fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.poster.avif?t=1750357673\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.webm?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.mp4?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work quickly to maximize your bonus pay \u2014 but carefully, as each accident reduces your bonus. This is a game of reflexes, strategy, and high scores. The more efficient you are, the higher you'll climb on the global leaderboard, the friends leaderboard, and your own personal ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim your spot among the best!</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Safety</strong> is a retro arcade game where you take on the role of a platform operator in a mining facility. Your job is to control a mobile structure to guide the little miners to the exit elevator \u2014 preferably alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.poster.avif?t=1750357673\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.webm?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/b1f99424fbcb47af5b1f1a78b3f635f3.mp4?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine never stops, and the machinery must stay on at all times. High-speed rotating drills are constantly digging in every direction, posing a deadly threat to the little miners. According to your contract, you're legally allowed to cause only a few workplace accidents. Go over the limit? You're fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.poster.avif?t=1750357673\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.webm?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/41f5a746c4cb9ab561078e0b7e70a6d4.mp4?t=1750357673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work quickly to maximize your bonus pay \u2014 but carefully, as each accident reduces your bonus. This is a game of reflexes, strategy, and high scores. The more efficient you are, the higher you'll climb on the global leaderboard, the friends leaderboard, and your own personal ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim your spot among the best!</strong> </p>",
